        "type": "mermaid",
        "code": "graph TD\n  U[Client apps] --> GW[API Gateway]\n  GW --> AUTH[Auth service]\n  GW --> ATLAS[Atlas core]\n  ATLAS --> DB[(Primary DB)]\n  ATLAS --> CACHE[(Redis cache)]\n  ATLAS --> Q[Event queue]\n  Q --> WORK[Async workers]\n  WORK --> DB\n  ATLAS --> SEARCH[(Search index)]",
